督夏口。及孫綝誅滕胤、呂據，據、胤皆壹皆之妹夫也，壹弟封又知胤、據謀，自殺。綝遣朱異潛襲壹。異至武昌，壹知其攻己，率部曲千餘口過將胤妻奔魏。魏以壹為車騎將軍、儀同三司，封吳侯，以故主芳貴人邢氏妻子。邢美色妒忌，下不堪命，遂共殺壹及邢氏。壹入魏三年死。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line029:m0130","object_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line029:m0134"}],"interpretation_note":"依本句具名端點及來源用詞。未見名的中間人或世次不予補足。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line029","text":"　　奐亦愛樂儒生，覆命部曲子弟就業，後仕進朝廷者數十人。年四十，嘉禾三年卒。子承嗣，以昭武中郎將代統兵，領郡。赤烏六年卒，無子，封承庶弟壹奉奐後，襲業為將。孫峻之誅諸葛恪也，壹與全熙、施績攻恪弟公安督融，融自殺。壹從鎮南遷鎮軍，假節督夏口。及孫綝誅滕胤、呂據，據、胤皆壹皆之妹夫也，壹弟封又知胤、據謀，自殺。綝遣朱異潛襲壹。異至武昌，壹知其攻己，率部曲千餘口過將胤妻奔魏。魏以壹為車騎將軍、儀同三司，封吳侯，以故主芳貴人邢氏妻子。邢美色妒忌，下不堪命，遂共殺壹及邢氏。壹入魏三年死。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line029:m0002","start":2,"end":3,"surface":"奐","kind":"person","person_id":"y4x_cmp_976_C","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line029:m0039","start":39,"end":40,"surface":"承","kind":"person","person_id":"y4x_cmp_976_CA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line029:m0068","start":68,"end":69,"surface":"壹","kind":"person","person_id":"wpk_253_fu9","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line029:m0070","start":70,"end":71,"surface":"奐","kind":"person","person_id":"y4x_cmp_976_C","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line029:m0078","start":78,"end":80,"surface":"孫峻","kind":"person","person_id":"ec3_vc7_z1i","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line029:m0082","start":82,"end":85,"surface":"諸葛恪","ki